  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_MastiffPhalone</defName>
    <label>mastiff phalone</label>
    <description>Mastiff phalone were carnivorous flightless avians native to the savannas of Maridun. The mastiff phalones had turkey-like heads with a sharp beak and a mane of large brown feathers which males of the species used in courtship displays. Mastiff phalones descended from flying creatures, with their wings evolved back into powerful limbs and tended to hunt in packs of two to four. They were popular big game animals due to their speed and ferocity and were exported to various worlds for such purposes.</description>
